              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />We hope you are as excited as we are to be part of our Zeta community. <br />Zeta Charter Schools began in 2018 with a dream for what education could make possible for students across New York City. At its heart was a simple idea: when you build a school around love for students, you build differently. <br /><br /><strong>What does it mean to build a school around love?<br /></strong><br />We often say <strong>Zeta is a love story.</strong> And we mean it. Every student in our schools is deeply known, their dreams are nurtured and they are empowered to become who they are capable of becoming."
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "bbf0ea99-526d-48e3-960b-d6dbbefe7dd2",
            "type" : "block"
          } ]
        } ]
      }, {
        "attributes" : {
          "lightning:backgroundImage" : {
            "position" : "center center",
            "repeat" : "no-repeat",
            "size" : "cover"
          },
