              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Love can sound abstract. <strong>At Zeta, it means something solid.</strong><br /><br /><strong>Love is whole child education</strong>:  developing students academically, socially, physically, and emotionally.<br /><br /><strong>Love is safety</strong>: creating an environment where students feel secure, supported, and ready to take ownership of their academics. <br />"
