              "lightning:typography" : {
                "fontFamily" : "{!$brand.baseFontFamily}",
                "fontSize" : "{!$brand.fontSize.medium}",
                "fontWeight" : "{!$brand.fontWeight.normal}",
                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<strong>Love is knowing every family</strong>: building meaningful partnerships with the people who know our students best.<br /><br /><strong>Love is academic rigor</strong>: believing every student is capable of excellence, challenging them, and giving them the support to reach high standards.<br /><br /><strong>Love is in our Specialties</strong>: giving children opportunities to discover talents and passions through art, music, chess, dance, sports, and more.<br /><br /><strong>Love is in our facilities</strong>: designing spaces that inspire curiosity, creativity, and a love of learning.<br /><br /><strong>Love is empowering every student </strong>in the city to build a future of their own choosing.<br /><br />We cannot wait to welcome your child to Zeta! Come visit a Zeta school, <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/?sftoken&#61;eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpYXQiOjE3ODk1NzU0ODQsImV4cCI6MTc4OTU3NTU0NCwiaW5kaXZpZHVhbElkIjoiaW5kaXZpZHVhbF9pZF9hYnNlbnQiLCJ0ZW5hbnRJZCI6ImEzNjAvcHJvZDIxLzZiMTEwNDZhM2VhZTQyMTM4Yjc1MzkyY2YyYTAzZmFlIiwiY29yZVRlbmFudElkIjoiY29yZS9wcm9kLzAwRGE1MDAwMDFBQTRCQkVBMSJ9.nNn0ejs6PONejnVl7eRo5ttdktXAgyQX6o0NiRuqUkg\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>sign up for an upcoming event or tour</u></a> to learn more about us!<br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br />✉️ <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>enroll&#6